00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.690
their children, many of them

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:06.530
have very young children are at home.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.220
And you can imagine getting work done,

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.360
while you're also doing childcare,

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.660
especially if your
children are very young.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:13.493
It's very difficult.

00:15:13.493 --> 00:15:14.900
And I know many of the
parents and teachers

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.950
out there listening are
coping with the same thing.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.650
You know, I consider
myself very fortunate.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:23.840
We have you know, I have
