00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.890
my wife and my mother-in-law lives with us

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:30.100
and that helps us kind of, be
able to tag team a little bit.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:33.310
And especially, since the
COVID crisis has been going on

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.920
and Khan Academy's load,
and in fact my workload

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:38.580
has gotten even higher than
